# {{ project_title }}

An AI-native application scaffolded from cliver-playbook with the
`{{ manifest.scaffold.profile }}` profile.

## Quick start

```sh
make init          # install Python, model-service and web dependencies
make db-init       # start PostgreSQL and apply every migration
make dev           # API + model service + web UI
make check         # lint, tests, contract check and web build
```

The API is the public entry point. The web and mobile clients call it over
HTTP; the API owns the agent runtime, authentication and provider routing. The
model service is internal.

