## Mobile

The native clients are thin: login/registration, profile and the reference
product CRUD call the API. There is no local API or model process on the phone.
Point the client at a reachable API base URL in the build configuration.

## Never commit

`.env`, `var/`, provider keys, model weights, or local build output.
